  "pages": [
    {
      "page_idx": 18,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "header",
          "index": 0,
          "bbox": [
            0.648,
            0.047,
            0.846,
            0.064
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Working with Fractions"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 1,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.087,
            0.58,
            0.107
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "How many such square bricks are needed?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 2,
          "bbox": [
            0.217,
            0.119,
            0.778,
            0.155
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Each square brick has an area of "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\frac { 1 } { 5 } } \\times { \\frac { 1 } { 5 } } = { \\frac { 1 } { 2 5 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " square units."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.216,
            0.164,
            0.78,
            0.201
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The total area to be covered is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "7 { \\frac { 1 } { 2 } } { \\mathrm {   s q .   u n i t s } } = { \\frac { 1 5 } { 2 } }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " sq. units."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.23,
            0.209,
            0.767,
            0.229
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "As (Number of bricks) × (Area of a brick) = Total Area,"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.361,
            0.246,
            0.637,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Number of bricks "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "= { \\frac { 1 5 } { 2 } } \\div { \\frac { 1 } { 2 5 } } ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.285,
            0.493,
            0.304
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The reciprocal of the divisor is 25."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.304,
            0.65,
            0.324
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Multiplying the reciprocal by the dividend, we get"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "equation",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.384,
            0.334,
            0.613,
            0.371
          ],
          "image_path": "images/page_18_equation_8.jpg",
          "content": "25 \\times \\frac{15}{2} = \\frac{25 \\times 15}{2} = \\frac{375}{2}"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.378,
            0.848,
            0.437
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "? "
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Example 5:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " This problem was posed by Chaturveda Pṛithūdakasvāmī (c. 860 CE) in his commentary on Brahmagupta’s book Brāhmasphuṭasiddhānta."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.441,
            0.848,
            0.515
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Four fountains fill a cistern. The first fountain can fill the cistern in a day. The second can fill it in half a day. The third can fill it in a quarter of a day. The fourth can fill the cistern in one fifth of a day. If they all flow together, in how much time will they fill the cistern?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.515,
            0.556,
            0.533
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Let us solve this problem step by step."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.534,
            0.497,
            0.552
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In a day, the number of times —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.556,
            0.662,
            0.576
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the first fountain will fill the cistern is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 { \\div } 1 = 1"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "footer",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.449,
            0.97,
            0.551,
            0.985
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Reprint 2026-27"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.582,
            0.732,
            0.616
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the second fountain will fill the cistern is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\div \\frac { 1 } { 2 } ="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.173,
            0.622,
            0.715,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the third fountain will fill the cistern is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\div { \\frac { 1 } { 4 } } ="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.174,
            0.661,
            0.726,
            0.696
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "• the fourth fountain will fill the cistern is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "1 \\div \\frac{1}{5} ="
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 18,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.705,
            0.846,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "The number of times the four fountains together will fill the cistern in a day is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "{ \\bf \\Delta } _ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } ^ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } + { \\bf \\Delta } _ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } ^ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } + { \\bf \\Delta } _ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } ^ { \\mathrm { ~ \\tiny ~ \\underline { ~ } ~ } } = 1 2"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 19,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.757,
            0.847,
            0.811
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Thus, the total time needed by the four fountains to fill the cistern together is "
            },
            {
              "type": "equation_inline",
              "content": "\\frac { 1 } { 1 2 }"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " days."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
